  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In Zener diode,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi>knee</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is the series resistance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;is the current through the resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>50</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></msub></mfenced><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mA</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(the maximum current through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>)</p><p>So the minimum value of the resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></msub></mfenced><mi>max</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>mA</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6000</mn><mn>75</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math></p>"
  }
